{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34423","headline":"奉和袭美谢友人惠人参 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美谢友人惠人参","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五叶初成椵树阴，紫团峰外即鸡林。\n名参鬼盖须难见，材似人形不可寻。\n品第已闻升碧简，携持应合重黄金。\n殷勤润取相如肺，封禅书成动帝心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}